WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.390
Magda's giant robot grabbed Roxy and squeezed.

2
00:00:04.391 --> 00:00:08.448
"Let me go!" Roxy tried to break free.

3
00:00:08.449 --> 00:00:13.299
Magda laughed. "Never!"

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.223
[i@Whiz-hoo!@i] Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

5
00:00:17.224 --> 00:00:19.869
A car flew off the robot's shoulder.

6
00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:24.338
"Yes!" Roxy fired again. [i@Whiz-hoo!@i]

7
00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:27.059
The arm broke off and fell to the ground.

8
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.622
Roxy quickly wriggled out of the robot's grip.

9
00:00:29.623 --> 00:00:31.470
The robot looked around.

10
00:00:31.471 --> 00:00:35.055
It grabbed a huge crane and swung it at Roxy.

11
00:00:35.056 --> 00:00:37.263
Roxy dodged it.

12
00:00:37.264 --> 00:00:41.637
Suddenly she noticed a large, round object hanging from the crane.

13
00:00:41.638 --> 00:00:44.451
"That's a magnet," Roxy thought.

14
00:00:44.452 --> 00:00:47.520
"I bet it's super strong!"

15
00:00:47.521 --> 00:00:51.110
The robot swung the crane again.

16
00:00:51.111 --> 00:00:54.684
Roxy flew into the driver's seat.

17
00:00:54.685 --> 00:00:56.634
A button read Magnet.

18
00:00:56.635 --> 00:00:58.044
She pressed it.

19
00:00:58.045 --> 00:01:01.111
The magnet began to hum.

20
00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:04.378
[i@Shuunk!@i] The robot's foot jerked up.

21
00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:06.039
It stuck to the magnet!

22
00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.144
The robot hopped on the other foot.

23
00:01:08.145 --> 00:01:12.480
"You're stuck!" Roxy laughed.

24
00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:15.464
She flew out of the crane and knocked the robot down.

25
00:01:15.465 --> 00:01:18.632
[i@Crash!@i] The robot crumpled.

26
00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:21.196
"Grr!" Magda shouted.

27
00:01:21.197 --> 00:01:24.037
She crawled out from under the pile of cars.

28
00:01:24.038 --> 00:01:25.866
She raised her arms.

29
00:01:25.867 --> 00:01:28.778
The crane stood up and floated in midair.

30
00:01:28.779 --> 00:01:32.744
"Uh-oh." Roxy flew toward Magda.

31
00:01:32.745 --> 00:01:34.792
The villain swung her arms.

32
00:01:34.793 --> 00:01:37.585
The crane struck Roxy.

33
00:01:37.586 --> 00:01:41.162
"Ouch!" Roxy landed in a pile of tires.

34
00:01:41.163 --> 00:01:43.920
Just then two cars flew toward Roxy.

35
00:01:43.921 --> 00:01:46.196
She ducked under the tires.

36
00:01:46.197 --> 00:01:50.495
The cars bounced off them.

37
00:01:50.496 --> 00:01:52.909
Magda made a piece of scrap metal rise.

38
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:58.077
"Now it's a hoverboard!" She hopped on and zoomed away.

39
00:01:58.078 --> 00:02:01.646
Roxy used her super breath. [i@Whoo-oo-oosh!@i]

40
00:02:01.647 --> 00:02:04.410
The tires rolled after Magda.

41
00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:07.704
The villain zigzagged to avoid them.

42
00:02:07.705 --> 00:02:11.480
But one tire bounced off an old washing machine.

43
00:02:11.481 --> 00:02:15.016
It flew and knocked Magda off her hoverboard.

44
00:02:15.017 --> 00:02:17.624
"Oof!" Magda said.

45
00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:19.297
Roxy flew fast.

46
00:02:19.298 --> 00:02:22.217
She grabbed a tire and slipped it over Magda.

47
00:02:22.218 --> 00:02:26.953
"I can't move my arms!" Magda stomped her foot.

48
00:02:26.954 --> 00:02:29.558
"This isn't fun anymore!"

49
00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:33.232
"You can have lots of fun in jail," Roxy said.

50
00:02:33.233 --> 00:02:41.188
"And trust me—your cell won't have metal bars!"

51
00:02:41.189 --> 00:02:44.451
Roxy returned to Mara's backyard with juice.

52
00:02:44.452 --> 00:02:47.474
Her friends were kicking a soccer ball around.

53
00:02:47.475 --> 00:02:51.972
"What happened to the Mara the Magnificent magic show?" Roxy asked.

54
00:02:51.973 --> 00:02:55.383
"Er . . ." Mara's face turned red.

55
00:02:55.384 --> 00:02:57.505
"I just know one trick.

56
00:02:57.506 --> 00:02:59.627
And Terrell guessed the secret.

57
00:02:59.628 --> 00:03:03.350
I used a magnet to make the coin dance."

58
00:03:03.351 --> 00:03:06.386
"It's still a great trick," Jack said.

59
00:03:06.387 --> 00:03:09.617
Terrell nodded. "Magnets are awesome.

60
00:03:09.618 --> 00:03:13.088
You can do so many things with them. Right, Roxy?"

61
00:03:13.089 --> 00:03:16.438
"Um . . ." Roxy gulped.

62
00:03:16.439 --> 00:03:21.930
"Does anybody want more juice?"

